Subject: [PATCH 5/5] hid, input: Switch 2 real command 213, nx2 mode, and Pro Controller fixes

Update hook to Brontide-NS2 1.1.0 and RenHDrum 0.3.0:
- Add real command 213 (SendVibrationValueInMode) dispatcher.
- Route guest Mode flag to RenHDrum via renhdrum_set_nx2_mode.
- Fix Switch Pro Controller right stick upward drift by clamping center offset.
- Synchronize controller attach and detach to prevent Raw Input deadlocks.
